  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中文思辨與表達(一)",
    "sub_ename": "CRITICAL THINKING AND EXPRESSION IN CHINESE(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為110學年度中文系Freshman Project結合定錨之課程，結合人文與數位，連結古典文學，將「敘事能力」與「人文精神」展現於與空間地景的對話。首先進行空間地景的散文或新詩創作，繼而寫作故事腳本、完成分鏡表並拍攝動態影片，終而完成各組海報和作品集的圖文編輯製作。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is a 110 academic year Chinese Department Freshman Project combined with anchoring courses, combining humanities and numbers, linking classical literature, and displaying \"narrative ability\" and \"humanistic spirit\" in a dialogue with space and landscape. First, create the prose or new poem of the space and landscape, then write the story script, complete the storyboard and shoot the dynamic film, and finally complete the graphic editing and production of each group of posters and portfolios.",
